WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.701 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You have four brothers?
-I do.

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:03.903 size:78% position:39%
-And you guys are all
pretty close in age?

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:06.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah. So, oldest is 45,
and then I'm 41.

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:08.742 line:92%
And it goes 41, 40, 38, 36.

00:00:08.742 --> 00:00:10.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, and, now,
is that close enough

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:11.745 size:81% position:41%
that you guys were all
wailing on each other?

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:15.949 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah. And not one person
was definitively winning.

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:16.616 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, gotcha.

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:19.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, so, like, any given day,
it was a coin flip,

00:00:19.753 --> 00:00:20.653 line:92%
because anything was game.

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:23.823
I've been chased with a
chain saw, with kitchen knives,

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:24.724 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
set on fire.

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:27.093 size:78% position:39%
There was an incident
with a hive of bees.

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:29.763
We tend not to talk about that.
Mustard was involved.

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:30.663 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It was weird.

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:34.501
Yeah, so that's life growing up
in West Newbury, Massachusetts.

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:36.036 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-You had an actual --

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:39.039
You guys built a wrestling ring
in your basement?

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:40.473 line:92%
-Yeah, so, to, like, corral us

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:42.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
from actually
not murdering each other.

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:44.744 align:start size:94% position:6%
We ended up locking ourselves
in the basement

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:47.147
and creating our own sports
entertainment federation.

00:00:47.147 --> 00:00:49.749
-And so you're young obviously,
but you're doing the thing

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:50.984 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you ended up
doing professionally.

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.653
At one point did you think,
"Oh, this might be a career"?

00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:56.423
Because I think a lot of people
wrestle in their basement

00:00:56.423 --> 00:00:58.825
and don't think,
"This is what I'm going to do."

00:00:58.825 --> 00:01:02.829 size:84% position:42%
-I still can't believe
they pay me to do this.

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:06.433 align:start size:94% position:6%
Joke's on you guys!
This is awesome!

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:08.368 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:09.936 line:92%
Aw, thank you, thank you.

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:12.872 align:start size:94% position:6%
The lesson to be learned
out there is love what you do,

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:15.608
because if you love what you do,
it's never a day of work.

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:17.710 align:start size:94% position:6%
So thank you, guys.
Thank you. Thank you.

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:20.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I feel lucky
in the exact same way.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:21.147 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You obviously --

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:24.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is a -- You know,
it's a half robot-based film,

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:25.985 line:92%
it's a half car-based film.

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:27.921 align:start size:94% position:6%
You are a car guy.
-Yeah.

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:28.588 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-And your actual --

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:31.124
Your first wrestling name
was kind of in the realm --

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:34.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, boy. I thought
we sunk the ship at CFO.

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:37.263 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This was -- Somebody
gave you this name, yes?

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:39.132 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you were called
The Prototype?

00:01:39.132 --> 00:01:39.566 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I was.

00:01:39.566 --> 00:01:41.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And was the idea
that you were a half-robot?

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:43.436 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The idea was --
I think the slogan was

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:48.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
"50% man, 50% machine,
100% mayhem!"

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:50.410 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-The Prototype!

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:51.945 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:51.945 --> 00:01:53.446 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Don't clap for that.

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:57.117 align:start size:94% position:6%
You definitely
have never seen this

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:58.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
if you were
putting your hands together.

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:01.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
You'd be like,
"Man, you owe me 20 bucks!"

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:04.390
It was awful. It was awful.
-What was your first car?

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:07.794 size:78% position:39%
-So, my first car was
an '84 Coupe DeVille,

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:08.995 line:92%
which I got at 14 and a half.

00:02:08.995 --> 00:02:11.397 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How were you allowed
to get a car at 14 and a half?

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:13.233 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, you know,
I kind of coerced my dad

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:14.400 line:92%
into putting up half the money.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I worked
at a very young age.

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:17.504
I got my first job at 13
as a youth league umpire.

00:02:17.504 --> 00:02:20.373 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, wow. I did that, as well.
It was really good money.

00:02:20.373 --> 00:02:22.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, it was.
It was a fun time.

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:23.042 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was great.
-Yeah.

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:25.145
-I was a bit eccentric,
but that's another story.

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:27.213 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But didn't you --
My favorite thing about it

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:28.848 line:92%
was you were doing it at 13,

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:31.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it was, like,
the kids were like 10 or 11.

00:02:31.451 --> 00:02:33.386 line:92%
And I loved just that authority.

00:02:33.386 --> 00:02:34.187 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Me too. Yes.

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:36.723
I thoroughly abused it, and I
owe a lot of people an apology.

00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:39.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did you have -- As an umpire,
did you have like --

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:41.761 align:start size:94% position:6%
Were you happy
with your called strike three?

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:44.164
Did you have a good one?
-I believe you're familiar

00:02:44.164 --> 00:02:45.932 align:start size:94% position:6%
with a movie called
"The Naked Gun."

00:02:45.932 --> 00:02:46.933 line:92%
-Yes. You would use those?

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:48.067 size:78% position:39%
-So, when I say I was
a bit eccentric...

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:50.236 align:start size:94% position:6%
For a Little League game
with about 25 parents there.

00:02:50.236 --> 00:02:52.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
Full splits. And moonwalks.
-Yeah.

00:02:52.105 --> 00:02:55.341
-Poor 11-year-old kid who's
trying to go back to the dugout.

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:58.545 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm so sorry. I'm so sorry.
-So Coupe DeVille?

00:02:58.545 --> 00:03:01.814 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, but I smoked the
transmission before I was 15,

00:03:01.814 --> 00:03:04.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I got rid of the car
before I could even drive.

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:06.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
First car I ever bought
with my own money,

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:07.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
I still have to this day.
-Really?

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:11.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A 1989 Jeep Wrangler.
It's got 185,000 miles on it.

00:03:11.758 --> 00:03:13.459 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's an inline-four.
It is a dog.

00:03:13.459 --> 00:03:15.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
But it's beautiful,
and I'll never sell it.

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:17.430 align:start size:94% position:6%
It is not for sale.
-That's fantastic.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.933
Hey, man, congratulations
on everything, as always.

00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:22.669
I know you're about to get
back in the ring, as well.

00:03:22.669 --> 00:03:27.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, December 26th!
The CFO is back!

